From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] luci-theme-bootstrap: footer as wide as the header
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The header and the page content are 1180 px wide, the footer was
padded for 940 px, so on wide screens the footer text started 120 px
to the right of the header and the content (checked in Chromium at
1400 px: 230 px instead of 110 px from the left edge).

The same change is in LuCI master.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Uo9XQuT7u6ShTYdi2S3Anq
---
 htdocs/luci-static/bootstrap/cascade.css | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/htdocs/luci-static/bootstrap/cascade.css b/htdocs/luci-static/bootstrap/cascade.css
index c1b214fc..384b1354 100644
--- a/htdocs/luci-static/bootstrap/cascade.css
+++ b/htdocs/luci-static/bootstrap/cascade.css
@@ -1371,8 +1371,8 @@ footer {
 	font-size: 12px;
 	color: var(--text-color-medium);
 	/* the redundant properties below work around a csstidy bug */
-	padding-left: calc((100% - 940px) / 2);
-	padding-right: calc((100% - 940px) / 2);
+	padding-left: calc((100% - 1180px) / 2);
+	padding-right: calc((100% - 1180px) / 2);
 }
 
 footer a {
-- 
2.43.0

